	)
	(text "WIDEBAND TIA — on-board PD front-end closes the PDH loop (FGA01FC -> TIA; replaces SMA coax J2/J3).\nRing-transmission InGaAs PD photocurrent (PD1_IN/PD2_IN) -> TIA virtual ground (IN-).  Vout = VREF_MID - Ipd*Rf at TIAx_OUT -> mixer RF port.\nU4/U42 = OPA859 (UNITY-GAIN STABLE, FET input, GBWP 1.8GHz; single +5V). IN+ biased to VREF_MID (~2.5V).\nRf = 8k (R810/R811) for low input-referred current noise; Cf = 1pF C0G 0402 (C810/C811). Transimpedance 8k -> Vout = Ipd*8k.\nf-3dB = 1/(2*pi*Rf*Cf) ~ 20MHz (>5-10x the 1-3MHz modulation).  C_in ~ 3.9pF (PD 2.0pF + OPA859 ~1.5pF + stray ~0.4pF).\nUnity-gain stable => decompensation limit Cf<=C_in/6 NO LONGER APPLIES. Cf set by bandwidth; flatness floor sqrt(C_in/(2pi*Rf*GBWP)) ~ 0.2pF, so Cf=1pF is flat/over-damped (no peaking).\nFLAG (cascade): output headroom — DC photocurrent clips at ~ (2.5-0.2)/8k ~ 290uA on single +5V; verify ring-PD DC photocurrent fits, else reduce Rf.\nFLAG: symbol lib_id still OPA858xDSG (pin/footprint compatible, BOM Value=OPA859xDSG). Re-confirm C_in and Cf against measured ring-PD capacitance (open item 4)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 23.622 110.744 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "39f3cdf4-4bbe-47c3-81d9-79cd38a024b6")
	)
	(text "EXTERNAL RING RESONATOR PD TIA + ANTI-ALIAS FILTER — Lock-in signal path"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 96.346 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "45dbbcbc-96d9-4e61-96b3-a393994dde38")
	)
	(text "Ext PD TIA: OPA380 Rf=2.7k Bw=1.3MHz  |  AAF: OPA2141 2-pole 30kHz Butterworth  |  Teensy ADC1/ADC2 @100kHz DMA lock-in"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
